<br>

<<logcount>>

You aren't in a good spot(such as your bedroom) to write your diary so you just recall recent events that you could write down.

<<if $diarymode is 1>> /* single day mode */
  <br>
  <<set _hiddenentries to 0>>
  <<for _i, _entry range $log[$diarypage]>>
  <<capture _i>>
  <<if _entry[$logpars.importance] gte $diaryfilterA >><br>
    <<if _i gt 1>><<print Math.floor($log[$diarypage][_i][$logpars.time] / 60).toString().padStart(2, "0")>>:<<print ($log[$diarypage][_i][$logpars.time] % 60).toString().padStart(2, "0")>><</if>>
    <<showlogentry $diarypage _i>>
  <<else>>
    <<set _hiddenentries += 1>>    
  <</if>>
  <</capture>>
  <</for>>
  <br><br>
  _hiddenentries less important entries are not shown.
<<else>> /* all days mode */
  <<set _hiddenentries to 0>>
  <<run $log.reverse()>>/* show current day first */
  <<for _i, _day range $log>>
    <br> /*  */
    <<for _j, _entry range $log[_i]>>
    <<capture _i, _j>>
    <<if _entry[$logpars.importance] gte $diaryfilterB >><br>
      <<if _j gt 1>><<print Math.floor($log[_i][_j][$logpars.time] / 60).toString().padStart(2, "0")>>:<<print ($log[_i][_j][$logpars.time] % 60).toString().padStart(2, "0")>><</if>>
      <<showlogentry _i _j>>
    <<else>>
      <<set _hiddenentries += 1>>    
    <</if>>
    <</capture>>
    <</for>>
  <</for>>
  <<run $log.reverse()>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
_hiddenentries less important entries are not shown.
<br><br>
