:: Diary Edit [nobr]
/* This is still using $diary( \$diary(?![plfsimdgeblcw]) ) instead of $log since editing the $log isn't something you are supposed to do and whenever I get around to actually adding $diary I might want to repurpose this for that. */
/* Diary but with edit options and disabled numberify  */[[Bedroom]]
 | <<return>>
 | <<link [[Show all days|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diarymode to 0>><</link>> filter: <<link [["<"|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diaryfilterB-->><</link>> $diaryfilterB <<link [[">"|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diaryfilterB++>><</link>> 
 | <<set $menu to 1>> <<link [[Show 1 day|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diarymode to 1>><</link>> filter: <<link [["<"|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diaryfilterA-->><</link>> $diaryfilterA <<link [[">"|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diaryfilterA++>><</link>>
 | <<if $logshowcomments is 1>><<link [[Hide|Diary Edit]]>><<set $logshowcomments to 0>><</link>><<else>><<link [[Show|Diary Edit]]>><<set $logshowcomments to 1>><</link>><</if>> comments
<<if $debug is 1>> | <<if $logshowopinions is 1>><<link [[Hide|Diary Edit]]>><<set $logshowopinions to 0>><</link>><<else>><<link [[Show|Diary Edit]]>><<set $logshowopinions to 1>><</link>><</if>> opinions<</if>>
<br>
/*
list and makes selectable all days
could make a year selector since this will probably get annoyingly long after a year or two.
yearlog would probably be an array and use .push($diary) at the end of year before emptying $diary.
compressing or exporting old entries could be a thing
*/Hmm
<<if $diarymode is 1>>
  Day:
  <<for _i to 0 ; _i lte $logday ; _i++>>
  <<capture _i>>/* prevents all of the links setting $diarypage to the last value _i was*/
  <<link [[_i|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diarypage to _i>> <</link>>
  <</capture>>
  <</for>>
<</if>>
<br>

/* originally I was thinking players could add entries on their own but that didn't seem as useful as just adding comments to existing ones */
Change entry $diaryline of day $diarypage's <<link [[comment|Diary Edit]]>><<logcomment $diarypage $diaryline $entry>><</link>><<textbox "$entry" "" >>
or importance(from <<print $diary[$diarypage][$diaryline][$logpars.importance]>> to /* Should I somehow protect entries with above 5 importance? Someone might change them and regret not being able to restore them */
<<link [[0|Diary Edit]]>><<logimportance $diarypage $diaryline 0>><</link>>
<<link [[1|Diary Edit]]>><<logimportance $diarypage $diaryline 1>><</link>>
<<link [[2|Diary Edit]]>><<logimportance $diarypage $diaryline 2>><</link>>
<<link [[3|Diary Edit]]>><<logimportance $diarypage $diaryline 3>><</link>>
<<link [[4|Diary Edit]]>><<logimportance $diarypage $diaryline 4>><</link>>
<<link [[5|Diary Edit]]>><<logimportance $diarypage $diaryline 5>><</link>>)


<<set _hiddenentries to 0>>
<<set _hiddenentriestotal to 0>>
<<set $diaryinsertfilterinfo to 2>>
<<if $diaryinsertfilterinfo is undefined>>
<</if>>
<<set $diaryfiltersum to {}>>
<<if $diarymode is 1>> /* single day mode */
  <br>
  <<for _i, _entry range $diary[$diarypage]>>
  <<capture _i>>
  <<if _entry[$logpars.importance] gte $diaryfilterA >>
    <<filteredentriesinfo>>
    <br>
    <<link [[■|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diaryline to _i>><</link>>
    <<if _i gt 1>><<print Math.floor($diary[$diarypage][_i][$logpars.time] / 60).toString().padStart(2, "0")>>:<<print ($diary[$diarypage][_i][$logpars.time] % 60).toString().padStart(2, "0")>><</if>>
    <<showdiaryentry $diarypage _i>>
  <<else>>
    <<set _hiddenentries += 1>>
    <<set _hiddenentriestotal += 1>>
    <<dontshowdiaryentry $diarypage _i>>
  <</if>>
  <</capture>>
  <</for>>
<<else>> /* all days mode */
  <<run $diary.reverse()>>/* show current day first */
  <<for _i, _day range $diary>>
    <br> /*  */
    <<for _j, _entry range $diary[_i]>>
    <<capture _i, _j>>
    <<if _entry[$logpars.importance] gte $diaryfilterB >>
      <<filteredentriesinfo>>
      <br>
      <<link [[■|Diary Edit]]>><<set $diarypage to $logday-_i>><<set $diaryline to _j>><</link>> /* $logday-_i prevents reversed day order from messing things up */
      <<if _j gt 1>><<print Math.floor($diary[_i][_j][$logpars.time] / 60).toString().padStart(2, "0")>>:<<print ($diary[_i][_j][$logpars.time] % 60).toString().padStart(2, "0")>><</if>>
      <<showdiaryentry _i _j>>
    <<else>>
      <<set _hiddenentries += 1>>
      <<set _hiddenentriestotal += 1>>
      <<dontshowdiaryentry _i _j>>
    <</if>>
    <</capture>>
    <</for>>
  <</for>>
  <<run $diary.reverse()>>
<</if>>
<<filteredentriesinfo>>
<br><br>
<<if _hiddenentriestotal gte 1>>
  <span class="black">(_hiddenentriestotal entries filtered out in total)
  <<if $diaryinsertfilterinfo is 0 and $diaryfiltersum isnot {}>>
    <<filteredstatchanges>>/* this should lists effects from all of the filtered entries when not reporting them mid diary, not sure if that's good */
  <</if>>
  </span> 
  <br>
  <<set _hiddenentriestotal to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
